title: FirstBudget_Start
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action grab_envelope>>
maya-didi: Open it. Don't be shy. Count it.
<<wait_for_action count_cash>>
maya-didi: Fifteen hundred. That is everything you'll get this month.
maya-didi: First paycheck. Same as mine, long ago. Mine lasted nine days.
<<player_choose>>
-> Why only nine days?
    maya-didi: No plan. Money without a plan is rent
    maya-didi: for the next person's pocket. Today, you make a plan.
    <<jump FirstBudget_ThreeEnvelopes>>
-> Just tell me what to do.
    maya-didi: Fine. No lecture. Three envelopes. Three buckets.
    <<jump FirstBudget_ThreeEnvelopes>>
===

title: FirstBudget_ThreeEnvelopes
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action open_drawer>>
maya-didi: Three envelopes. Rent. Save. Spend.
maya-didi: Rent is first. Always first.
maya-didi: Put $480 in Rent. That is what you owe the chair at the alley.
<<wait_for_action fill_envelope rent 480>>
maya-didi: Good. Now Save. Put at least $200.
maya-didi: Not later. Now. Before you decide what to spend.
<<player_choose>>
-> Put $200 into Save.
    <<wait_for_action fill_envelope save 200>>
    maya-didi: You paid yourself before you paid the world. That is the form.
    <<set_flag paid_self_first>>
    <<jump FirstBudget_SpendRemainder>>
-> Put only $50 into Save.
    <<wait_for_action fill_envelope save 50>>
    maya-didi: Fifty is something. Two hundred is a plan.
    maya-didi: Try once more. The envelope is paper, not stone.
    <<jump FirstBudget_RetrySave>>
-> Skip Save for now.
    maya-didi: No. The drawer's whole point is in that second envelope.
    maya-didi: One more try. I'll wait.
    <<jump FirstBudget_RetrySave>>
===

title: FirstBudget_RetrySave
tags:
---
maya-didi: Look at it this way. Two hundred a month is twenty-four hundred a year.
maya-didi: One emergency you swallow instead of borrow for.
<<wait_for_action fill_envelope save 200>>
maya-didi: Better. Pay yourself first. Every single time.
<<set_flag paid_self_first>>
<<jump FirstBudget_SpendRemainder>>
===

title: FirstBudget_SpendRemainder
tags:
---
maya-didi: Whatever is left — $820 — goes to Spend.
maya-didi: Tea, food, bus, soap. All of it. From this envelope.
<<wait_for_action fill_envelope spend 820>>
maya-didi: Now say the math out loud. Income minus expenses equals…?
<<player_choose>>
-> Savings.
    maya-didi: Correct. Income minus expenses equals savings.
    maya-didi: That is the whole budget. The rest is decoration.
    <<set_flag understands_income_minus_expenses>>
-> Whatever is left.
    maya-didi: Close. "Whatever is left" has a name —
    maya-didi: savings. Income minus expenses equals savings.
    <<set_flag understands_income_minus_expenses>>
<<continue>>
<<grant_mastery budgeting.income-expense 1>>
<<set_flag finished_first_budget>>
maya-didi: Tomorrow Arlo will try to sell you something foolish.
maya-didi: Now the envelope can say no for you.
===
